/public/
/resources/_gen/
/.hugo_build.lock
# Claude Code's working directory is local, EXCEPT settings.json — that one is
# project configuration and has to be committed to apply to anyone working here.
# Note the trailing /* rather than /: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# DIRECTORY is excluded, so a plain `/.claude/` makes the negation below a no-op.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json